\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For every uniformly discrete bounded-geometry metric space X, is reduced coarse assembly $KX_{1}(X)\otimes Q\to K_{1}(C*(X))\otimes Q$ injective, including coarse disjoint unions of finite connected bounded-degree graphs?

\subsection{Short English statement}
